cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the replication prior, please cite it as below."
title: "In the Meantime: A Bayesian replication prior for psychology"
abstract: >-
  A Bayesian hierarchical prior, trained on five replication corpora
  (OSC 2015, Many Labs 1, Many Labs 2, Camerer 2018, and validated
  out-of-sample on SCORE), that forecasts the replication effect size
  of a new psychology study from its original effect and the planned
  replication sample size. Includes the full reproducible analysis,
  data, posterior draws, and a portable paste-in prior.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Blair
    given-names: J. Pete
    affiliation: "ALERRT Center, Texas State University"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-06-08
license: CC-BY-4.0
